---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing"
  description="Zahari monthly membership: one coin for $4.99, five for $8.99, or all eight launch coins for $12.99."
>
  <section class="pricing-page page-width">
    <p class="eyebrow">ZAHARI MEMBERSHIP</p>
    <h1>Choose the worlds you keep close.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Every tier is a monthly card subscription. The difference is how many of
      the eight launch coins you can select.
    </p>
    <div class="plan-grid">
      <article class="plan-card">
        <span class="pill">ONE COIN</span>
        <h2>One</h2>
        <p class="plan-price">$4.99 <span>USD / month</span></p>
        <p>One world to return to.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Choose one launch coin</li>
          <li>Explore its available authored 3D models</li>
          <li>Change the light, orbit and save a view</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="plan-card featured">
        <span class="pill">FIVE COINS</span>
        <h2>Five</h2>
        <p class="plan-price">$8.99 <span>USD / month</span></p>
        <p>A small constellation of your own.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Choose five launch coins</li>
          <li>Each gets the same full world controls</li>
          <li>Move between your selected worlds</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="plan-card">
        <span class="pill">EIGHT COINS</span>
        <h2>Eight</h2>
        <p class="plan-price">$12.99 <span>USD / month</span></p>
        <p>The whole launch collection.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>AAVE, BNB, BTC, ETH, LINK, SOL, UNI and XAUT</li>
          <li>Access every launch coin world</li>
          <li>Move between all eight subjects</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="pricing-footnote">
      The public sample is separate from membership; it is not a free plan.
      Checkout and coin selection are being connected. No card can be charged
      on this page today. Market-driven changes and news are not active yet.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
